{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2635580/extras/3bf1fb5b50f67904e6beb8c0baf4c818.webp?t=1726155390\" width=256 height=35 /></span><br>Immerse yourself in a thought-provoking, story-driven adventure. Experience the deeply emotional narrative that explores themes of family, loss and self-discovery.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Discover and read numerous short stories<br></li><li>Interact with other characters and creatures<br></li><li>Uncover clues of Arith\u2019s history<br></li><li>Draw connections between the world of Arith and your forgotten childhood</li></ul><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2635580/extras/64273067cd7316f38e863b79ec08207e.poster.avif?t=1726155390\" width=600 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2635580/extras/64273067cd7316f38e863b79ec08207e.webm?t=1726155390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2635580/extras/64273067cd7316f38e863b79ec08207e.mp4?t=1726155390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2635580/extras/04c3fad68451e2d4d5a6c21c8fbfa2a8.webp?t=1726155390\" width=256 height=35 /></span><br>Collect dozens of items that help you on your journey to uncover the secrets of your past and those of the world of Arith.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Find notes and letters that shed light on mysteries <br></li><li>Discover useful tools to aid in progression</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2635580/extras/8a0f9034fff3763ba549118ff34e29b6.poster.avif?t=1726155390\" width=600 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2635580/extras/8a0f9034fff3763ba549118ff34e29b6.webm?t=1726155390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2635580/extras/8a0f9034fff3763ba549118ff34e29b6.mp4?t=1726155390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2635580/extras/3f2d088fc996e1eadb74115e6794be6e.webp?t=1726155390\" width=256 height=35 /></span><br>Test your skills in over 30 diverse puzzles, including: <br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>World environment observations<br></li><li>Symbol deciphering and pattern recognition<br></li><li>Word riddles and memory<br></li><li>Unique story driven puzzles</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2635580/extras/32b2cb5df339bb777bde80d796f804ca.poster.avif?t=1726155390\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2635580/extras/32b2cb5df339bb777bde80d796f804ca.webm?t=1726155390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2635580/extras/32b2cb5df339bb777bde80d796f804ca.mp4?t=1726155390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2635580?t=1726155390","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2635580/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1726155390","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2635580/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1726155390","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2635580